        "created_at": "2013-03-14T22:32:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'd also say yes, because Kismet has a start-of-turn flip and a start-of-turn action which specifies that it does not activate on the turn she flips. Such a clause implies that if it wasn't there then the action would happen immediately.</p>",
