        "created_at": "2013-03-15T15:37:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Chrono\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chrono/48/2334_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Chrono:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So when Citizen Dawn flips, unless you are playing with 5 players, she flips right back? Wouldn't Omnitron just keep flipping back and forth and never let anything else happen if you activated the Start of Turn effect every time it flips?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>No he will not as its card reads he only flips once per villian turn.</p>",
